# Targets the gateway in docker compose. For dotnet run, use https://localhost:7092 instead.
@gateway = http://localhost:8090

### Authorized: the card number ends in an odd digit
# @name authorized
POST {{gateway}}/api/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cardNumber": "2222405343248877",
  "expiryMonth": 4,
  "expiryYear": 2030,
  "currency": "GBP",
  "amount": 1050,
  "cvv": "123"
}

### Retrieve the payment created above
GET {{gateway}}/api/payments/{{authorized.response.body.$.id}}

### Idempotent: send this twice and both responses have the same id, with one bank call
POST {{gateway}}/api/payments
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: order-1001

{
  "cardNumber": "2222405343248877",
  "expiryMonth": 4,
  "expiryYear": 2030,
  "currency": "GBP",
  "amount": 1050,
  "cvv": "123"
}

### Same key, different amount: 422 because the key was used for a different payment
POST {{gateway}}/api/payments
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: order-1001

{
  "cardNumber": "2222405343248877",
  "expiryMonth": 4,
  "expiryYear": 2030,
  "currency": "GBP",
  "amount": 9999,
  "cvv": "123"
}

### Declined: the card number ends in an even digit
POST {{gateway}}/api/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cardNumber": "2222405343248878",
  "expiryMonth": 4,
  "expiryYear": 2030,
  "currency": "GBP",
  "amount": 1050,
  "cvv": "123"
}

### Bank unavailable: the card number ends in 0, so the simulator returns 503 and the gateway returns 502
POST {{gateway}}/api/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cardNumber": "2222405343248870",
  "expiryMonth": 4,
  "expiryYear": 2030,
  "currency": "GBP",
  "amount": 1050,
  "cvv": "123"
}

### Rejected: invalid card number, expired card and unsupported currency, so the bank is not called
POST {{gateway}}/api/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cardNumber": "1234",
  "expiryMonth": 1,
  "expiryYear": 2020,
  "currency": "JPY",
  "amount": 0,
  "cvv": "12"
}

### Unknown payment
GET {{gateway}}/api/payments/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Simulator: how many payment requests reached the bank (see numberOfRequests)
GET http://localhost:2525/imposters/8080
